# =============================================================================
# OBSERVATORY — .gitignore
#
# The first block is the one that matters. This project's whole purpose is
# recording network traffic and browser state, so the working files it
# produces are, by construction, sensitive: real browsing history, real
# request bodies, and live session tokens. None of it belongs in git.
#
# The default OBSERVATORY_ROOT is ~/observatory, outside any checkout, so
# these normally never appear here. They are listed anyway for the case where
# someone points OBSERVATORY_ROOT at the repository, or copies output in for
# a closer look and forgets it is there.
# =============================================================================

# --- Captured and recorded data ---------------------------------------------
captures/
crawls/
archives/
screenshots/
sessions/
logs/

*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.cap

*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.db

# Selenium session state. authenticated_session.py writes cookies and
# localStorage to JSON — these are live credentials, not just metadata.
session_state.json
*_state.json
cookies.json

# --- Credentials -------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.creds
credentials.json
protonvpn.conf
*.ovpn
*.pem
*.key

# --- Provisioned tooling -----------------------------------------------------
# Written into OBSERVATORY_ROOT by script_setup.sh, not authored here.
.venv/
venv/
openwpm-repo/
datasette/metadata.json
docker-compose.override.yml
MANUAL.md

# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Editors and OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
